WEBVTT

01:26.570 --> 01:29.780
[Glory]

01:30.600 --> 01:32.880
[Episode 2]

01:33.060 --> 01:35.240
[Rong Residence]

01:36.310 --> 01:37.039
This is mine.

01:37.789 --> 01:38.200
Mine.

01:38.200 --> 01:38.950
-Brother Zhang, please.
-This is mine.

01:38.950 --> 01:39.509
What brings

01:39.509 --> 01:40.950
so many Young Masters here?

01:40.950 --> 01:43.000
It said that the Tea King, Rong Family,
seeks a husband for the daughter.

01:43.000 --> 01:43.680
Really?

01:44.280 --> 01:45.470
The Rong Family
is one of the wealthiest in the land.

01:45.470 --> 01:46.259
I wonder which Young Master will

01:46.259 --> 01:47.509
have the honor of being chosen?

01:47.509 --> 01:48.640
So many people here.

02:08.710 --> 02:10.190
What is this huge crowd doing here?

02:10.190 --> 02:10.660
My Lord.

02:10.910 --> 02:12.570
The Rong family is choosing
a husband for Miss Rong.

02:12.570 --> 02:14.120
The whole Linji is buzzing about it.

02:14.120 --> 02:15.080
Many noble families

02:15.080 --> 02:16.470
are rushing to the Rong family.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.150
My Lord, it'd be better not to

02:17.150 --> 02:17.870
trouble them

02:17.870 --> 02:18.930
at a time like this.

02:20.190 --> 02:21.400
I shall see for myself

02:21.400 --> 02:23.230
what manner of house this Rong family is,

02:23.230 --> 02:25.110
that so many are drawn to its gate.

02:25.970 --> 02:26.790
Go surround it.

02:26.790 --> 02:27.320
Yes.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.160
- Make way!
- Make way!

02:32.610 --> 02:33.170
Make way!

02:33.910 --> 02:35.520
Why are there so many officers?

02:35.520 --> 02:36.640
Make way! Step back!

02:36.640 --> 02:37.760
What are you doing?

02:39.590 --> 02:41.280
We bear an invitation from

02:41.280 --> 02:42.750
Magistrate Lu of Chunning County,

02:42.750 --> 02:45.750
humbly requesting the honor of
Lady Rong's presence.

02:47.079 --> 02:47.750
What is this about?

02:47.750 --> 02:49.400
What...What's happening here?

02:49.400 --> 02:49.960
My Lord.

02:50.530 --> 02:52.060
Are we just going to wait like this?

02:52.060 --> 02:52.620
Yes.

02:53.690 --> 02:56.130
Until Lady Rong agrees to see us.

03:09.040 --> 03:10.710
His eyes are too small.

03:12.040 --> 03:14.300
This one's face is longer than a horse's.

03:17.240 --> 03:17.890
Next.

03:19.800 --> 03:22.060
A bulging brow and sunken eyes--so ugly.

03:22.590 --> 03:24.250
What in the world is this face!

03:24.630 --> 03:26.360
Not good. None of these will do.

03:27.350 --> 03:28.680
They do not good indeed.

03:29.730 --> 03:30.400
Jingyi.

03:31.680 --> 03:34.050
Return all the birth charts and portraits.

03:34.050 --> 03:36.090
Send away those who came in person too.

03:36.090 --> 03:37.130
Just tell them.

03:38.079 --> 03:39.800
If they want our Rong family's

03:39.820 --> 03:41.380
precious tea seeds next year,

03:41.380 --> 03:42.540
they should select

03:42.560 --> 03:43.840
their finest clansman

03:44.400 --> 03:45.910
and send them to our place for selection

03:45.910 --> 03:47.700
before the spring tea harvest.

03:48.140 --> 03:48.579
Yes.

04:01.790 --> 04:02.590
Grandmother!

04:03.790 --> 04:04.590
Grandmother!

04:04.660 --> 04:05.460
Grandmother!

04:06.910 --> 04:08.040
Why're you so panic?

04:09.230 --> 04:10.290
Still so immature.

04:10.630 --> 04:12.510
Those people outside
are causing trouble again.

04:12.510 --> 04:13.790
I've tried repeatedly to persuade them,

04:13.790 --> 04:15.590
but they refused to move an inch.

04:16.459 --> 04:17.320
Check out this.

04:26.510 --> 04:27.310
Take a look.

04:38.020 --> 04:39.090
How insolent!

04:39.510 --> 04:40.070
Madam Yang

04:40.070 --> 04:41.750
clearly had her husband killed.

04:41.750 --> 04:43.510
What does that have to do with
the Rong family?

04:43.510 --> 04:45.260
They demanded a witness for the court,

04:45.260 --> 04:47.140
and we already sent a steward to appear.

04:47.140 --> 04:49.000
We’ve shown them every courtesy.

04:49.140 --> 04:51.750
How dare they expect Grandmother to appear
in court herself!

04:51.750 --> 04:52.460
I heard that

04:52.460 --> 04:53.900
the newly appointed Magistrate Lu

04:53.900 --> 04:54.700
seems to be

04:54.700 --> 04:56.140
Minister Xu's
prized protégé from the capital.

04:56.140 --> 04:57.400
He's pretty arrogant.

04:57.580 --> 04:58.580
That Prefect Xu demanded double

04:58.580 --> 04:59.750
the usual tribute from

04:59.750 --> 05:01.410
our tea plantation last year,

05:01.870 --> 05:03.510
but Grandmother refused him outright.

05:03.510 --> 05:04.550
It seems this year

05:04.630 --> 05:06.670
he wants to use this young magistrate

05:06.670 --> 05:08.510
to test the Rong family's background.

05:08.510 --> 05:09.310
Prefects and Governors

05:09.310 --> 05:11.020
come and go like revolving lanterns,

05:11.020 --> 05:12.430
yet our Rong family has stood firm
in Linji

05:12.430 --> 05:13.290
for centuries.

05:13.780 --> 05:16.020
A mantis cannot block
the path of a mighty cart.

05:16.020 --> 05:17.990
With the county exams approaching,

05:17.990 --> 05:18.580
all we need is

05:18.580 --> 05:20.670
to anonymously circulate
a few inflammatory posters

05:20.670 --> 05:23.220
and encourage the students
to petition for a boycott,

05:23.220 --> 05:25.880
which'd be enough
to make Governor Jiang yield.

05:31.670 --> 05:33.130
What do you think, Bao'er?

05:34.870 --> 05:36.870
I see three problems with this plan.

05:37.190 --> 05:37.900
First,

05:38.340 --> 05:40.870
the Rong family'd inevitably be suspected
of coercing the Governor,

05:40.870 --> 05:42.780
thus handing others
a ready-made accusation.

05:42.780 --> 05:45.630
Second, it'd delay the students from
taking the exams,

05:45.630 --> 05:48.090
going against
Grandmother’s intention of supporting

05:48.090 --> 05:49.950
poor students to benefit the community.

05:49.950 --> 05:50.700
Thirdly,

05:51.140 --> 05:53.310
in the eyes of ordinary citizens of Linji,

05:53.310 --> 05:54.900
the Rong family'd become
unscrupulous gentry

05:54.900 --> 05:55.380
who incited examination boycotts

05:55.380 --> 05:57.110
and disregarded law and order.

05:59.380 --> 06:01.310
Haven't we been supporting
those poor students

06:01.310 --> 06:03.190
all along precisely for
such a critical time?

06:03.190 --> 06:05.070
If we hesitate and waver now,

06:05.580 --> 06:06.950
won't Grandmother end up
being publicly questioned in court

06:06.950 --> 06:08.550
under the gaze of thousands?

06:08.750 --> 06:09.750
Don't forget that

06:09.900 --> 06:10.900
the Wei family's tea plantation,

06:10.900 --> 06:12.780
though now entirely owned
by the Yang family,

06:12.780 --> 06:14.110
their ancient tea trees

06:14.140 --> 06:16.200
are rooted in the Rong family garden.

06:16.460 --> 06:17.750
Who knows what the people of Linji

06:17.750 --> 06:18.670
will say.

06:19.140 --> 06:19.870
Indeed.

06:20.310 --> 06:21.700
If you're really so capable,

06:21.700 --> 06:24.030
why don't you
come up with a good solution?

06:32.190 --> 06:33.590
I certainly won't let him

06:33.700 --> 06:35.760
act so recklessly in the Rong family.

06:44.010 --> 06:48.870
[Rong Residence]

06:44.950 --> 06:46.460
We bear an invitation from

06:46.460 --> 06:48.190
Magistrate Lu of Chunning County,

06:48.190 --> 06:51.190
humbly requesting the honor of
Lady Rong's presence.

06:51.190 --> 06:52.909
We respectfully request
the prescene of Lady Rong!

06:52.909 --> 06:55.110
What's happening with the Rong family?

06:55.140 --> 06:56.630
I heard they're harboring a runaway woman

06:56.630 --> 06:58.070
and sheltering criminals.

06:58.070 --> 07:00.040
Who doesn's know Lady Rong's character?

07:00.040 --> 07:01.070
Without any evidence,

07:01.070 --> 07:02.340
isn't this just nonsense?

07:02.340 --> 07:03.550
-Yeah.
-Exactly.

07:03.550 --> 07:04.680
Complete nonsense!

07:05.900 --> 07:06.460
My Lord.

07:09.340 --> 07:10.550
It's been three days already.

07:10.550 --> 07:11.780
The Rong family seems to be
carrying on as usual,

07:11.780 --> 07:13.580
no sign of any unusual activity.

07:13.950 --> 07:16.480
The whole Linji is talking about
this matter.

07:16.530 --> 07:18.070
I don't believe that Lady Rong

07:18.070 --> 07:20.330
can remain so calm as if nothing happens.

07:21.900 --> 07:24.360
My Lord,
the Governor urgently summons you.

07:27.600 --> 07:30.380
[Governor's Office]

07:27.750 --> 07:29.340
We demand to see Your Excellency!

07:29.340 --> 07:30.340
Your Excellency!

07:30.870 --> 07:32.510
We need to see Your Excellency!

07:32.510 --> 07:33.430
With no referral,

07:33.430 --> 07:34.670
how can we sit for the exam?

07:34.670 --> 07:35.110
Yes!

07:35.110 --> 07:36.310
If I fail to achieve merit and fame,

07:36.310 --> 07:37.909
I shall forfeit my very life!

07:38.020 --> 07:38.900
If we can't see My Lord,

07:38.900 --> 07:39.780
we're not leaving.

07:39.780 --> 07:41.140
Right, we're not leaving!

07:41.140 --> 07:42.430
We must see Your Excellency!

07:42.430 --> 07:53.750
Your Excellency!

07:53.750 --> 07:55.020
Your feet! Step back!

07:55.020 --> 07:56.220
Your Excellency! Your Excellency!

07:56.220 --> 07:57.950
I need to see Your Excellency!

07:57.470 --> 07:59.020
[Book of People]

07:57.950 --> 07:58.950
Your Excellency!

07:58.950 --> 07:59.750
Let us in!

07:59.900 --> 08:00.510
Step back!

08:00.780 --> 08:03.140
My Lord, something seems to have happened.

08:03.140 --> 08:03.820
I saw that.

08:04.760 --> 08:05.380
Use the back door.

08:05.380 --> 08:05.820
Yes.

08:09.190 --> 08:10.510
If you're investigating the case,
then you can just investigate.

08:10.510 --> 08:12.640
But who allowed you
to provoke the Rong family?

08:12.640 --> 08:14.820
You've even made
Lady Rong ill with anger.

08:14.820 --> 08:15.480
Check this.

08:16.260 --> 08:18.310
This is a petition from the students.

08:18.310 --> 08:21.240
They're forcing the Your Excellency
to dismiss you.

08:22.220 --> 08:24.580
Anyone who incites students
to boycott the exams shall,

08:24.580 --> 08:26.670
by law, face the sentence of death
by hanging with a reprieve.

08:26.670 --> 08:28.070
As an imperial official,

08:28.510 --> 08:30.950
how can you be controlled
by the Rong family?

08:30.950 --> 08:32.740
Are they actually boycotting the exams?

08:32.740 --> 08:33.620
No.

08:34.100 --> 08:36.030
The stipend scholars
of Linji,

08:36.030 --> 08:38.030
our of support and
indignation for Lady Rong,

08:38.030 --> 08:39.950
have refused to provide guarantees.

08:39.950 --> 08:41.620
When the students heard of this,

08:41.620 --> 08:42.909
they gathered outside County Office,

08:42.909 --> 08:45.370
appealing to
Your Excellency to intervene.

08:45.910 --> 08:46.580
Let me ask you.

08:46.580 --> 08:48.580
Without guarantees from stipend scholars,

08:48.580 --> 08:50.640
how can students enter the exam hall?

08:50.950 --> 08:52.580
What about the county examination?

08:52.580 --> 08:54.840
And what about
prefectural and provincial exams?

08:54.840 --> 08:56.970
If the capital holds you accountable,

08:56.980 --> 09:00.100
your head won't be where it is now.

09:01.270 --> 09:02.670
They dare to refuse guarantees?

09:02.670 --> 09:03.670
How dare they not?

09:04.190 --> 09:06.740
Since ancient times, stipend scholars
provide guarantees voluntarily.

09:06.740 --> 09:08.580
No matter how you interpret the law,

09:08.580 --> 09:10.510
you won't find any fault with them.

09:12.950 --> 09:14.480
I've repeatedly warned you

09:14.860 --> 09:17.390
to consider
the dignity of wealthy families.

09:17.550 --> 09:19.580
The Rong family has great prestige
in this area,

09:19.580 --> 09:21.510
and we can't offend them casually.

09:21.820 --> 09:22.680
Look at you now,

09:22.700 --> 09:23.900
creating such a mess.

09:24.550 --> 09:26.480
All I did was spread a simple rumor,

09:26.950 --> 09:29.390
yet the Governor and the Prefect
are thrown into disarray.

09:29.390 --> 09:32.380
Who would have thought
the Rong family had such a player?

09:32.380 --> 09:34.040
My Lords, don't be so worried.

09:34.560 --> 09:36.860
I've already invited
the coroner Chen from Suzhou.

09:36.860 --> 09:38.620
Once they open the coffin for examination,

09:38.620 --> 09:40.190
whether Madam Yang is alive or dead,

09:40.190 --> 09:42.450
the truth will eventually come to light.

09:42.470 --> 09:44.380
Lu Jianglai, you're so insolent!

09:45.030 --> 09:47.100
If you continue this reckless course,

09:47.100 --> 09:49.180
calamity will descend like Mount Tai,

09:49.180 --> 09:51.500
crushing a minor county magistrate
like you

09:51.500 --> 09:53.670
to dust.

09:54.220 --> 09:56.190
You are still too young and impulsive.

09:56.190 --> 09:59.050
It's time to rein in
before plunging over the cliff.

10:07.050 --> 10:07.480
You...

10:10.790 --> 10:12.450
My Lords, please look at this.

10:12.460 --> 10:13.500
What is this?

10:14.500 --> 10:15.520
[Royal Edict]

10:17.340 --> 10:18.910
Your humble servant receives the decree!

10:18.910 --> 10:21.240
Your humble servant receives the decree!

10:22.500 --> 10:24.620
I carry His Majesty's imperial edict.

10:24.620 --> 10:27.620
I serve not merely as County Magistrate,
but as Imperial Inspector,

10:27.620 --> 10:29.270
dispatched to patrol the realm,

10:29.270 --> 10:31.190
assess local governance,
redress wrongful grievances,

10:31.190 --> 10:33.620
and adjudicate all cases great and small
in the sovereign's name.

10:33.620 --> 10:34.860
No matter how high your rank

10:34.860 --> 10:36.190
or how great your power,

10:36.460 --> 10:38.950
when I say we'll open the coffin
for examination,

10:38.950 --> 10:41.770
anyone who dares to obstruct
is defying imperial orders

10:41.770 --> 10:44.300
and will be severely punished
without mercy.

11:02.220 --> 11:02.790
My Lord.

11:03.310 --> 11:04.500
An urgent message from the capital

11:04.500 --> 11:06.230
brings a letter of Minister Xu.

11:06.420 --> 11:07.880
[To the Chunning Magistrate, Lu Jianglai]

11:16.270 --> 11:17.030
Be cautious.

11:18.150 --> 11:19.150
This case has so quickly

11:19.150 --> 11:20.880
alarmed people in the capital.

11:21.030 --> 11:22.890
My mentor sent me these two words.

11:22.910 --> 11:24.220
What could be his intention?

11:24.220 --> 11:25.950
My Lord, it's about 10 p.m. now.

11:26.500 --> 11:27.360
Time to depart.

11:28.430 --> 11:29.000
Prepare the sedan chair.

11:29.000 --> 11:29.390
Yes.

11:45.860 --> 11:47.150
Has the coroner arrived?

11:47.150 --> 11:48.150
Rest assured, My Lord.

11:48.150 --> 11:49.190
He is waiting for you

11:49.190 --> 11:50.850
at the abandoned grave ahead.

12:24.790 --> 12:25.240
You...

12:25.820 --> 12:27.190
My Lord, you defy powerful gentry

12:27.190 --> 12:28.580
and shield no former allies,

12:28.580 --> 12:30.640
recklessly flaunting your prowess.

12:31.190 --> 12:32.500
Yet don't you know that
the treacherous tides of officialdom

12:32.500 --> 12:34.090
are fraught with hidden blades and spears

12:34.090 --> 12:35.750
where every step is hindered,

12:36.070 --> 12:39.000
and you may well destroy your own life
in the process?

12:44.740 --> 12:45.220
Chase!

12:45.310 --> 12:45.790
Chase!

13:21.070 --> 13:22.840
Some watch our Miss bask in the glory,

13:22.840 --> 13:24.860
and their eyes are burning green with
envy behind your back.

13:24.860 --> 13:26.150
Miss was afraid that after spring

13:26.150 --> 13:27.270
the pest would spread,

13:27.270 --> 13:29.560
so you rushed to the tea garden overnight
to treat the diseased plants.

13:29.560 --> 13:31.390
What a relentless labor of devotion
this has been!

13:31.390 --> 13:32.150
And now

13:32.430 --> 13:34.430
they've all turned blind to your efforts.

13:34.430 --> 13:35.670
Watch out your mouth!

13:35.670 --> 13:36.800
You should talk less

13:36.950 --> 13:38.700
just in case you will annoy our Miss.

13:38.700 --> 13:39.860
You chatterbox.

13:40.430 --> 13:42.790
You'll be ruined by your mouth someday.

13:43.220 --> 13:44.820
You're asking for a beating.

13:44.860 --> 13:46.790
Miss may look cold but has a warm heart.

13:46.790 --> 13:48.650
You can‘t frighten a maid like me.

14:02.910 --> 14:05.220
Miss, it looks like someone ahead

14:05.220 --> 14:06.880
has fallen down the mountain.

14:26.760 --> 14:28.630
♪ The stars and moon descend ♪

14:28.650 --> 14:34.060
♪ Into the mortal world♪
♪ Where blossoms wither and hearts break ♪

14:34.080 --> 14:35.800
♪ How persistent ♪

14:35.830 --> 14:40.770
♪ How can such a fleeting grace♪
♪ Ever be forgotten ♪

14:41.100 --> 14:42.730
♪ Beacon fires rise high ♪

14:42.750 --> 14:48.110
♪ One last dance, then the music ends♪
♪And the crowd departs ♪

14:49.880 --> 14:54.650
♪ To seek the next crescent moon's light ♪

14:59.820 --> 15:02.620
Bandits often pretend
to be dead from starvation.

15:03.100 --> 15:04.430
Check out this blood.

15:05.270 --> 15:07.000
He doesn't look like a good man.

15:07.270 --> 15:07.910
Bury him.

15:22.980 --> 15:23.910
Please.

15:27.950 --> 15:29.190
Help me.

15:40.130 --> 15:40.930
Take him back.

16:12.660 --> 16:14.060
[Young Lu Jianglai]

16:14.870 --> 16:15.910
Help!

16:40.700 --> 16:41.430
Who are you?

16:45.170 --> 16:46.430
Someone who saved you.

17:36.590 --> 17:37.260
Who are you?

17:39.020 --> 17:40.280
Someone who saved you.

17:42.390 --> 17:44.250
Everyone has only ever harmed me.

17:44.860 --> 17:46.190
No one has ever saved me.

17:47.370 --> 17:48.240
Now there is.

18:05.550 --> 18:08.530
[Rong]

18:10.590 --> 18:11.880
That day I heard people

18:11.910 --> 18:13.040
calling him Lord Lu.

18:13.910 --> 18:15.300
I assumed he must be

18:15.610 --> 18:18.010
the new Chunning Magistrate, Lu Jianglai.

18:18.680 --> 18:19.720
But you said

18:20.260 --> 18:22.910
everything at the County Office
has been normal lately?

18:22.910 --> 18:24.570
I had people inquire about it.

18:24.830 --> 18:25.630
Everyone at the County Office

18:25.630 --> 18:27.030
is saying the same thing.

18:27.150 --> 18:27.980
They say that Lu Jianglai

18:27.980 --> 18:29.520
was actually an Imperial Inspector

18:29.520 --> 18:31.700
who recently received a confidential
letter from the capital

18:31.700 --> 18:33.540
and immediately returned to the capital.

18:33.540 --> 18:35.270
I'm suspicious about this too.

18:35.590 --> 18:36.920
If he's not Lu Jianglai,

18:37.260 --> 18:38.300
then who is he?

18:41.870 --> 18:43.930
You really don't remember anything?

18:58.500 --> 18:59.740
Three fatal wounds.

18:59.740 --> 19:01.020
Eight clear blade wounds.

19:01.020 --> 19:02.150
A bloody mess.

19:02.150 --> 19:03.540
The fall left him senseless.

19:03.540 --> 19:04.150
Miss

19:04.150 --> 19:05.540
sacrificed two century-old ginseng roots

19:05.540 --> 19:06.700
to save his life.

19:07.060 --> 19:09.120
I know he'll definitely be a trouble.

19:10.300 --> 19:11.630
Miss.

19:12.260 --> 19:13.460
Since no one has come looking for him,

19:13.460 --> 19:14.620
he must be a vagrant.

19:14.830 --> 19:16.430
We should just drive him out.

19:17.060 --> 19:17.910
Drive him out?

19:18.750 --> 19:21.670
Where am I supposed to seek payment
for the treatment?

19:21.670 --> 19:24.020
If he's fortunate enough
to survive in the future,

19:24.020 --> 19:26.150
I'll let him stay at the Rong Residence

19:26.220 --> 19:27.590
and work as my coachman.

19:30.810 --> 19:32.400
[Chongxi Hall]

19:48.100 --> 19:50.480
[Next year February]

20:01.990 --> 20:03.830
[Rong Residence]

20:11.060 --> 20:12.120
Wang Lu from Suzhou

20:12.390 --> 20:14.630
has come to pay respects to Lady Rong.

20:15.670 --> 20:16.470
Please enter.

20:17.820 --> 20:19.310
[Wang Lu]

20:21.670 --> 20:23.020
Song Yifang,
from Luxiang of East Mountain, Suzhou,

20:23.020 --> 20:24.420
has come to pay respects.

20:25.700 --> 20:27.350
Zhuang Shimin from Fuliang, Raozhou,

20:27.350 --> 20:28.750
has come to pay respects.

20:30.300 --> 20:32.670
Zuo Liangyu from Nanjing
has come to pay respects.

20:32.670 --> 20:34.460
Lin Shishuo from Yi County, Huizhou,

20:34.460 --> 20:35.860
has come to pay respects.

20:36.150 --> 20:36.950
Please enter.

20:38.340 --> 20:39.320
Good heavens!

20:39.540 --> 20:40.830
It's so lively here.

20:40.980 --> 20:42.030
Are they all here

20:42.120 --> 20:43.450
to propose to Miss Rong?

20:44.700 --> 20:46.220
If Miss Rong gets married,

20:46.260 --> 20:47.430
what future is there for the Rong family's

20:47.430 --> 20:48.870
ten-thousand-mu tea legacy?

20:48.870 --> 20:50.780
For hundreds of years, the Rong family
has never married off their daughters.

20:49.620 --> 20:51.740
[Bai Yansheng]

20:50.780 --> 20:52.020
They only take in live-in sons-in-law.

20:52.020 --> 20:52.740
If one could become

20:52.740 --> 20:53.780
the Rong family's son-in-law,

20:53.780 --> 20:56.440
wouldn't that be like
falling into a pot of gold?

21:10.300 --> 21:12.360
Bai Yingsheng from Wanfeng Academy.

21:13.020 --> 21:15.430
This Young Master is so handsome!

21:21.280 --> 21:23.250
[Yang Dingchen]

21:33.910 --> 21:34.500
Mr. Yang,

21:34.950 --> 21:37.080
please wait in the Flower Hall for tea.

21:56.300 --> 21:57.780
How grand, isn't it?

21:58.500 --> 21:59.830
Look how many there are!

22:07.390 --> 22:09.590
Are you recommended by Principal Liu?

22:12.260 --> 22:12.740
Please.

22:14.540 --> 22:15.830
Who is this Young Master?

22:15.830 --> 22:16.830
So extravagant!

22:17.590 --> 22:19.120
Look at this TYoung Master.

22:21.660 --> 22:22.800
[He Xingming]

22:24.460 --> 22:25.150
Mr. He.

22:32.950 --> 22:34.210
He Xingming from Huqiu

22:34.440 --> 22:37.000
has come to propose to Miss Rong.

22:47.780 --> 22:49.240
I was wondering who it was.

22:49.430 --> 22:50.670
Didn't the He family boast

22:50.670 --> 22:52.700
that their Huqiu Tea of Mountain Wu
is the best in the world

22:52.700 --> 22:54.740
and vow to surpass the Rong family?

22:55.260 --> 22:56.910
How come Mr. He has stooped so low

22:56.910 --> 22:59.040
as to come begging for their tea seeds?

22:59.780 --> 23:01.060
When my family's Huqiu Tea

23:01.060 --> 23:02.430
was renowed throughout the world,

23:02.430 --> 23:03.870
Yangxian, Tianchi,

23:03.870 --> 23:04.630
Beiyuan and Songluo

23:04.630 --> 23:06.110
were content to be mere inferiors.

23:06.110 --> 23:07.700
The Rong family's Longjing tea

23:07.700 --> 23:08.670
wasn't even known by anyone

23:08.670 --> 23:09.270
back then.

23:09.460 --> 23:12.590
How come our Young Master
isn't good enough to marry her?

23:14.430 --> 23:16.830
Events from just a decadee ago
are too shameful to recall,

23:16.830 --> 23:17.910
and yet you dare trumpet achievements

23:17.910 --> 23:19.630
from a hundred years back?

23:30.430 --> 23:31.700
She is mine.

23:44.700 --> 23:46.630
Young Masters, you must
be weary from your journey.

23:46.630 --> 23:49.090
Please, take your rest
at Xinfang Pavilion.

23:52.980 --> 23:54.540
This courtyard has a beautiful view.

23:54.540 --> 23:55.350
Yes, indeed.

23:56.740 --> 23:57.670
Look over there.

23:57.780 --> 23:59.780
How exquisite. Look, Young Master.

24:16.590 --> 24:17.390
Guess who I am?

24:18.670 --> 24:20.330
Cousin, stop fooling around.

24:22.740 --> 24:23.630
Bao'er, you must have eyes

24:23.630 --> 24:25.260
in the back of your head.

24:25.980 --> 24:27.350
How many times have I told you

24:27.350 --> 24:28.550
to call me Xiangling?

24:28.830 --> 24:30.700
Weren't you studying at the academy?

24:30.700 --> 24:31.740
Why did you suddenly come here?

24:31.740 --> 24:32.670
Does Uncle know?

24:33.110 --> 24:33.910
If I didn't come,

24:33.500 --> 24:36.530
[Wen Can]

24:34.020 --> 24:35.390
and let someone arrange your marriage,

24:35.390 --> 24:36.020
wouldn't I regret it

24:36.020 --> 24:37.280
for the rest of my life?

24:37.460 --> 24:38.390
I'm here to win.

24:38.740 --> 24:39.540
You won't win.

24:40.500 --> 24:42.020
You don't want

24:42.020 --> 24:43.030
a childhood sweetheart,

24:43.030 --> 24:43.980
but you insist on choosing from
a bunch of strangers

24:43.980 --> 24:45.440
with unknown intentions?

24:45.510 --> 24:47.310
Bao'er, you're so confused.

24:47.670 --> 24:48.540
Miss Rong,

24:48.700 --> 24:50.260
all Young Masters have all arrived
at the mansion.

24:50.260 --> 24:52.220
Are you really not going to take a look?

24:52.220 --> 24:53.060
Silly girl.

24:53.350 --> 24:55.410
Xiangling already has me by her side.

24:55.410 --> 24:56.090
Years ago,

24:56.110 --> 24:57.770
my aunt fled to the Wen family,

24:57.850 --> 24:59.780
and she was grateful that
my father gave her some soup.

24:59.780 --> 25:01.270
They then became sworn siblings.

25:01.270 --> 25:02.590
When the Wen family declined later,

25:02.590 --> 25:03.980
she'd often bring me

25:04.120 --> 25:05.250
to play with you.

25:05.670 --> 25:07.000
We may be family by oath,

25:07.100 --> 25:08.740
but we're closer than most real family.

25:08.740 --> 25:10.330
You are my cousin
who was raised in luxury,

25:10.330 --> 25:11.630
being so innocent and sincere.

25:11.630 --> 25:14.220
When've you ever experienced
harsh realities in life?

25:14.220 --> 25:15.040
Once you've experienced

25:15.040 --> 25:16.740
the fierce competition for victory,

25:16.740 --> 25:18.630
then come and speak your heart to me.

25:18.630 --> 25:21.190
Then please await the good news,
Xiangling.

25:32.460 --> 25:33.510
Keep a close eye on him.

25:33.510 --> 25:34.440
I understand.

25:34.980 --> 25:36.040
Don't worry, Miss.

26:06.260 --> 26:08.190
They've sent dozens of troublemakers today

26:08.190 --> 26:08.870
without a thought for

26:08.870 --> 26:10.600
whether we can handle them all.

26:14.540 --> 26:15.470
Hey, the new one!

26:15.590 --> 26:16.510
You need to hurry.

26:16.510 --> 26:17.440
If it rains tomorrow,

26:17.440 --> 26:18.980
this stench will spread for miles.

26:18.980 --> 26:19.780
By then, if it bothers those noble guests,

26:19.780 --> 26:21.310
you'll be beaten with a rod.

26:23.150 --> 26:23.980
Move it! Move it!

26:23.980 --> 26:24.670
You...You!

26:24.700 --> 26:25.900
Get that out of my way!

26:27.350 --> 26:29.350
You're really asking for a beating.

26:30.060 --> 26:31.540
The horses eat fresh grass

26:31.540 --> 26:33.190
delivered from the meadows every day.

26:33.190 --> 26:35.250
Fresh horse dung should be greenish.

26:35.430 --> 26:36.910
Only these few horses have droppings

26:36.910 --> 26:37.910
as hard as stones.

26:38.090 --> 26:39.830
These horses also look listless.

26:39.830 --> 26:41.910
We should find someone
who can treat sick horses.

26:41.910 --> 26:42.910
This is from being driven too hard
on the road

26:42.910 --> 26:44.300
without feeding them enough water.

26:44.300 --> 26:45.230
What do you know?

26:46.060 --> 26:47.150
Miss Rong is kind-hearted

26:47.150 --> 26:48.320
to give you those few bowls of leftovers,

26:48.320 --> 26:49.830
but don't think you're something special?

26:49.830 --> 26:50.700
Mr. Wen brought

26:50.700 --> 26:51.870
these prized horses from Northern Ji

26:51.870 --> 26:53.460
are fed only the finest fodder.

26:53.460 --> 26:54.800
Who'd dare let anything happen to them?

26:54.800 --> 26:56.150
If you dare talk nonsense again,

26:56.150 --> 26:57.630
I'll report you to the steward.

26:57.630 --> 26:58.630
Then they'll pin you to the ground

26:58.630 --> 27:00.350
and give you thirty lashes first.

27:00.350 --> 27:01.450
What are you waiting for?

27:01.450 --> 27:02.530
Before sunset,

27:02.870 --> 27:03.980
hurry and take those vats of

27:03.980 --> 27:04.870
fermented manure

27:04.870 --> 27:05.680
to the garden.

27:06.460 --> 27:07.260
Hurry up!

27:09.950 --> 27:11.110
Dillydallying...

27:12.060 --> 27:12.950
It's not worth arguing with

27:12.950 --> 27:14.350
such a fool over nothing.

27:14.590 --> 27:15.500
I must find out from Miss Rong

27:15.500 --> 27:16.870
about my background and identity.

27:16.870 --> 27:18.930
Then I can leave this wretched place.

27:28.460 --> 27:29.260
Brother Yang.

27:29.390 --> 27:31.070
The host hasn't invited us yet,

27:31.070 --> 27:32.780
but we're sneaking into this garden.

27:32.780 --> 27:34.710
I'm afriad if this is appropriate.

27:34.740 --> 27:36.000
We're not animals that

27:36.150 --> 27:37.190
they can keep us in Xinfang Pavilion,

27:37.190 --> 27:38.910
and only give us some water and grass.

27:38.910 --> 27:40.370
The Rong family never said

27:40.460 --> 27:42.460
we couldn't stroll in their garden.

27:42.740 --> 27:44.940
Besides, with Brother Yang here today,

27:45.390 --> 27:45.950
which one of those

27:45.950 --> 27:47.340
arrogant servants would

27:47.340 --> 27:48.200
dare to stop us?

27:49.890 --> 27:51.010
Yes, yes, yes.

27:51.300 --> 27:52.430
We're just following

27:52.430 --> 27:53.830
to broaden our horizons.

27:54.110 --> 27:55.590
When it comes to

27:55.590 --> 27:57.350
who is most deserving of Miss Rong's hand,

27:57.350 --> 27:59.540
Brother Yang is without a doubt the man.

27:59.540 --> 28:01.430
But I've heard the Rong family's

28:01.740 --> 28:03.800
marriage traditions are different.

28:04.320 --> 28:07.580
They don't allow formal engagements
or wedding banquets.

28:08.150 --> 28:11.500
But if the marriage
doesn't work out later,

28:12.020 --> 28:14.540
even a son-in-law
who has entered the Rong household

28:14.540 --> 28:16.870
will be immediately
sent back to his family.

28:16.870 --> 28:17.780
The Rong family's search for a son-in-law

28:17.780 --> 28:19.910
was an old story from thirty years ago.

28:20.020 --> 28:21.740
It's only natural that ordinary folk

28:21.740 --> 28:22.950
wouldn't know the details.

28:22.950 --> 28:24.830
Yangs are a prominent family in Linji.

28:24.830 --> 28:26.360
Even if others are unaware,

28:26.520 --> 28:28.850
how could Brother Yang possibly not know?

28:29.220 --> 28:31.110
I was just about to ask Brother Yang.

28:31.110 --> 28:33.670
Is it real that
the Rong family is run by women?

28:34.020 --> 28:36.250
Is it true that
women are superior to men?

28:36.250 --> 28:37.910
In years past, when the couple fell out,

28:37.910 --> 28:38.630
did they truly set a precedent by

28:38.630 --> 28:40.020
"removing the father
and keeping the offspring"?

28:40.020 --> 28:41.830
And what exactly is this "Tea Bone"

28:41.830 --> 28:43.500
that's been passed down
through the generations?

28:43.500 --> 28:45.560
Has the Rong family's immense wealth

28:45.870 --> 28:47.430
truly fallen on

28:47.740 --> 28:48.740
Miss Rong's shoulders alone?

28:48.740 --> 28:51.050
If you're fortunate enough to become
the Rong family's son-in-law,

28:51.050 --> 28:53.510
you'll naturally know
what you need to know.

28:54.480 --> 28:56.470
I'm afraid you don't have such luck,

28:56.470 --> 28:57.670
so why bother asking?

28:59.590 --> 29:01.260
I'm just curious, that's all.

29:01.740 --> 29:03.350
Although we have some wealth,

29:03.350 --> 29:05.820
compared to the Rong family,
it's like a drop in the ocean.

29:05.820 --> 29:07.830
But you, Brother Yang,
with your impressive wealth,

29:07.830 --> 29:10.190
why do you also come
to join this excitement?

29:10.190 --> 29:11.450
None of your business.

29:11.830 --> 29:12.430
Yes.

29:12.590 --> 29:15.520
Your criticism
is most enlightening, Brother Yang.

29:16.110 --> 29:17.240
You thieving beast!

29:17.740 --> 29:18.590
What are you looking at?

29:18.590 --> 29:20.390
Where did this filthy trash come from?

29:20.390 --> 29:22.220
How dare he eavesdrop on our conversation!

29:22.220 --> 29:23.750
I... I'll leave right away.

29:27.300 --> 29:29.540
I am an honored guest invited by
the Rong family.

29:29.540 --> 29:30.870
What is that murmuring!

29:30.950 --> 29:31.870
You bastard!

29:31.980 --> 29:33.440
Showing no respect at all!

29:47.350 --> 29:48.290
Clean my shoe!

29:49.630 --> 29:51.300
Young Master Wang, please don't be angry.

29:51.300 --> 29:52.110
I... I...

29:52.220 --> 29:53.950
I'll clean them for you right away.

29:53.950 --> 29:55.490
Wang what?

29:55.700 --> 29:56.980
No wonder he's carrying manure.

29:56.980 --> 29:58.220
It turns out he's half-deaf.

29:58.220 --> 29:59.020
Brother Wang,

29:59.220 --> 30:00.740
don't bother arguing with a deaf guy.

30:00.740 --> 30:02.740
It'll be a disgrace to your dignity.

30:03.170 --> 30:05.100
Wang Lu, tell him to leave quickly.

30:06.260 --> 30:07.060
Wang Lu.

30:07.950 --> 30:10.280
Fine. I'll remember you.

30:10.740 --> 30:11.540
Get lost now!

30:12.520 --> 30:13.980
Are you waiting for a slap?

30:14.630 --> 30:15.060
Who?

30:33.590 --> 30:35.480
Even before you beat a dog,
you should need to know who its master is.

30:35.480 --> 30:38.340
Our Rong family isn't a place
for you to make a scene.

30:40.190 --> 30:42.050
Miss Rong, please don't be angry.

30:42.220 --> 30:43.950
My friend here acted rashly

30:44.220 --> 30:45.220
and offended you.

30:45.430 --> 30:45.890
Wang Lu,

30:46.460 --> 30:48.460
hurry up and apologize to Miss Rong.

30:50.980 --> 30:52.640
Please forgive me, Miss Rong.

30:53.020 --> 30:54.190
I heard everything

30:54.430 --> 30:55.230
you just said.

30:55.670 --> 30:56.730
In the Rong family,

30:57.060 --> 30:58.790
if someone is looked down upon,

30:59.320 --> 31:00.980
it's never because he is a man,

31:01.870 --> 31:03.870
but because he lacks intelligence,

31:03.910 --> 31:05.110
has poor characters,

31:05.350 --> 31:07.480
and fails to serve his family loyally.

31:07.950 --> 31:10.390
When a woman can manage the household
and pursue a career,

31:10.390 --> 31:12.520
it's not simply because she is a woman,

31:12.780 --> 31:14.630
but because she possesses
both virtue and talent,

31:14.630 --> 31:16.290
earning everyone's respect.

31:16.740 --> 31:18.350
This talk of male superiority

31:18.350 --> 31:19.670
or female superiority

31:20.300 --> 31:22.190
is something I've never heard before.

31:22.190 --> 31:24.500
The Rong family has always disdained
such discussions.

31:24.500 --> 31:27.220
Allow me to ask our guests
to respect our traditions

31:27.220 --> 31:29.300
and refrain from
such disrespectful remarks.

31:29.300 --> 31:30.740
We were all ignorant

31:30.910 --> 31:32.060
and spoke arrogantly.

31:32.060 --> 31:33.590
It's all my fault.

31:34.590 --> 31:36.020
Knowing it was our first meeting,

31:36.020 --> 31:37.630
I refrained from speaking bluntly

31:37.630 --> 31:38.960
to avoid offending you.

31:39.300 --> 31:41.900
Please forgive my impropriety, Miss Rong.

31:55.950 --> 31:57.280
Mr. Wang has a hot temper

31:57.430 --> 31:58.760
and has frightened you.

31:58.830 --> 32:00.360
Take this to calm yourself.

32:03.000 --> 32:05.090
Duplicitous and self-destructive.

32:05.540 --> 32:06.950
This kind of guy
is treacherous to the core.

32:06.950 --> 32:08.260
If Miss Rong marries him,

32:08.260 --> 32:10.460
the Rong family line will come to an end.

32:11.220 --> 32:13.750
Thank you for your generosity,
Young Master.

32:16.780 --> 32:18.920
Alright, show them out.

32:21.830 --> 32:22.430
Miss Rong.

32:49.350 --> 32:51.020
It's all because of this wretched beast

32:51.020 --> 32:51.460
who made me

32:51.460 --> 32:53.060
lose face in front of Miss Rong!

32:53.060 --> 32:53.990
-I...
-Mr. Wang.

32:54.980 --> 32:55.950
We're hosting a banquet today
at Xinfang Pavilion

32:55.950 --> 32:57.460
for distinguished guests.

32:57.460 --> 32:59.660
If you don't go back now, you'll be late.

32:59.740 --> 33:00.800
All Young Masters,

33:01.220 --> 33:01.870
please.

33:16.430 --> 33:18.250
Lovely as the peony in spring,

33:18.500 --> 33:20.630
yet cold as the steel that scours bone.

33:20.970 --> 33:22.300
You stepped in with your feigned defense

33:22.300 --> 33:25.300
after I'd already endured
all the scolding and blows.

33:25.830 --> 33:26.300
No way.

33:26.770 --> 33:28.230
I need to see you privately

33:28.430 --> 33:29.960
to get a clear explanation.

33:42.910 --> 33:44.700
Miss, I think you're overthinking.

33:44.700 --> 33:46.230
He really did hurt his head.

33:46.430 --> 33:48.350
Otherwise, with his usual scheming nature,

33:48.350 --> 33:51.010
how could he allow others
to bully him like this?

33:52.630 --> 33:54.690
Time reveals a person's true nature.

33:54.830 --> 33:56.760
Did he stumble
into it by accident,

33:56.980 --> 33:58.440
or deliberately sneak in?

33:59.350 --> 34:01.010
We'll figure that out one day.

34:02.110 --> 34:03.640
If he has ulterior motives,

34:04.190 --> 34:05.990
he'll suffer the consequences.

34:08.659 --> 34:10.320
Send him a bottle of medicine.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.320
Miss.

34:11.870 --> 34:13.500
Reviving Hall's "Corpse-Reviver Elixir"

34:13.500 --> 34:14.949
costs a hundred taels per pill,

34:14.949 --> 34:17.150
which is more than a decade of his wages!

34:17.719 --> 34:19.380
You're certainly being generous.

34:19.380 --> 34:20.909
Then give him one pill only,

34:21.139 --> 34:22.139
in case he dies

34:22.790 --> 34:24.790
and wastes my two old ginseng roots.

34:40.139 --> 34:42.310
So many people are after
the Rong family fortune

34:42.310 --> 34:43.570
and Miss Rong herself.

34:44.310 --> 34:46.429
Only if we two join forces
against our enemies

34:46.429 --> 34:48.489
do we have
a slight chance of success.

34:49.100 --> 34:50.030
So you're saying

34:50.429 --> 34:51.980
you want to form an alliance with me?

34:51.980 --> 34:53.620
At tonight's the Rong family banquet,

34:53.620 --> 34:55.389
I shall first offer you
my pledge of loyalty

34:55.389 --> 34:56.909
as the proof of my good sincerity.

34:56.909 --> 34:58.040
How does that sound?

35:03.530 --> 35:04.330
Young Master,

35:04.830 --> 35:06.620
hosting a banquet is one thing,

35:07.140 --> 35:08.430
but why'd the Rong family

35:08.430 --> 35:10.100
consider it necessary

35:10.540 --> 35:12.460
to provide such beautiful companions?

35:12.460 --> 35:15.040
The royal family, to avoid choosing
the wrong groom for the princess,

35:15.040 --> 35:18.230
always sends palace maids to test
the groom before the wedding.

35:18.230 --> 35:20.360
The Rong family is a prestigious clan.

35:20.500 --> 35:22.900
They want to test their future son-in-law.

35:23.140 --> 35:24.270
I dare to guess,

35:24.710 --> 35:27.140
if a Young Master is
fortunate enough to get chosen,

35:27.140 --> 35:28.270
it may well depend on

35:28.430 --> 35:30.090
whether the maid is willing to

35:30.360 --> 35:32.820
put in a good word for him
before the hostess.

35:34.830 --> 35:35.830
Let's have another drink.

35:35.830 --> 35:38.350
With a beauty here to warm and serve wine,

35:43.310 --> 35:45.310
even if I don't win Miss Rong's hand,

35:45.500 --> 35:48.020
I can still count the evening well spent.

35:51.660 --> 35:53.860
This trial by wine and beauty will prove

35:54.060 --> 35:55.430
who is clear-headed enough

35:55.430 --> 35:57.430
for what comes next, the real tests.

35:57.430 --> 35:59.030
Let's apply a bit of pressure

35:59.580 --> 36:00.750
and help wash away

36:00.750 --> 36:02.410
a few unworthy grains of sand.

36:09.620 --> 36:10.950
This is excellent wine.

36:11.910 --> 36:13.270
Have some more, Young Master.

36:13.270 --> 36:14.470
Yes, yes, no problem.

36:20.680 --> 36:22.340
I really can't drink anymore.

36:23.020 --> 36:23.660
Mr. Wen.

36:24.540 --> 36:25.980
With the host's wine,

36:26.310 --> 36:28.240
let me first propose a toast to you.

36:29.540 --> 36:31.140
Mr. Wen, why are you

36:31.140 --> 36:32.800
drinking jasmine wine alone?

36:32.950 --> 36:34.790
Young ladies may favor
its floral sweetness,

36:34.790 --> 36:36.750
but it's a bit too mild for our tastes.

36:36.750 --> 36:39.460
Here, try this Autumn Dew White.

36:43.670 --> 36:44.800
Here, Brother Wang,

36:45.390 --> 36:46.450
let me toast to you.

36:57.950 --> 36:59.060
Today, two friends of mine

36:59.060 --> 37:00.990
accidentally offended Miss Rong.

37:01.430 --> 37:02.960
They feel deeply regretful

37:03.090 --> 37:05.850
and I was hoping
you could help smooth things over.

37:05.850 --> 37:06.400
Here.

37:06.620 --> 37:08.480
Young Master, you worry too much.

37:12.660 --> 37:13.310
Mr. Wen.

37:15.660 --> 37:17.270
Your two families are so related.

37:17.270 --> 37:19.140
Since you'll be
visiting each other often in the future,

37:19.140 --> 37:21.540
I hope we may
call upon your kindness often.

37:22.270 --> 37:24.140
Mr. Wen, such small cups
are no way to enjoy a drink!

37:24.140 --> 37:24.950
Let's switch to bigger cups.

37:24.950 --> 37:25.910
-Come on, Mr. Wen.
-No, no, thanks.

37:25.910 --> 37:26.370
Come on.

37:29.880 --> 37:30.280
Come.

37:32.060 --> 37:32.910
Here, come.

37:32.910 --> 37:33.500
-Let me fill your cup.
-Mr. Wen.

37:33.500 --> 37:35.300
Let's all have a drink together.

37:35.350 --> 37:37.580
We won't leave until we're drunk tonight.

37:37.580 --> 37:38.170
Brother Bai.

37:38.170 --> 37:39.230
Let's just enjoy our drinks.

37:39.230 --> 37:40.790
Brother Bai, we've not finished yet.

37:40.790 --> 37:41.660
Exactly. I have a fine piece of

37:41.660 --> 37:42.500
calligraphy at my place.

37:42.500 --> 37:43.180
Let's go to my place.

37:43.180 --> 37:44.180
-No, no.
-Let’s go.

37:44.180 --> 37:44.950
-Let's go.
-Come on.

37:44.950 --> 37:45.950
-Bottoms up.
-No need.

37:45.950 --> 37:46.500
Really, there's no need.

37:46.500 --> 37:47.540
Let's go, Brother Bai.

37:47.540 --> 37:47.910
Drink.

37:47.910 --> 37:48.570
Bottoms up.

37:49.350 --> 37:50.010
Bottoms up.

37:50.180 --> 37:50.640
Come on.

37:51.500 --> 37:52.500
Good tolerance.

37:56.070 --> 37:57.530
Here, let me fill your cup.

37:59.270 --> 37:59.870
Slow down.

38:06.620 --> 38:08.830
Don't rush. Let me close the door first.

38:13.390 --> 38:14.180
Who are you?

38:14.540 --> 38:15.600
What are you doing?

38:21.310 --> 38:21.840
Who is it?

38:30.350 --> 38:31.620
You drive away and beat
your guests for no reason.

38:31.620 --> 38:32.720
How can you justify this?

38:32.720 --> 38:33.390
-That’s right.
-Yeah.

38:33.390 --> 38:34.830
I want to speak to Miss Rong about this.

38:34.830 --> 38:36.140
Our Rong family meant to kindly host

38:36.140 --> 38:37.140
guests from afar.

38:37.310 --> 38:39.640
But we don't treat lecherous scoundrels.

38:39.660 --> 38:40.710
We served you with good wine and meat,

38:40.710 --> 38:42.370
but we've fed a bunch of swine!

38:42.950 --> 38:44.790
How dare you get drunk
and harass our maids?

38:44.790 --> 38:46.190
Have you lost your minds?

38:46.310 --> 38:47.540
One more word out of any of you,

38:47.540 --> 38:48.500
and you'll be tied up
and hauled to the County Office,

38:48.500 --> 38:50.700
Let them have your backs beaten to pulp!

38:50.710 --> 38:51.180
But...

38:51.890 --> 38:54.420
Didn't your family mention
a trial marriage?

38:54.430 --> 38:55.540
What trial?

38:55.540 --> 38:56.740
Trial your fool head!

38:56.750 --> 38:57.950
Have you been swilling so much wine

38:57.950 --> 38:59.350
that your mouth spews filth?

38:59.350 --> 38:59.980
You're not fit to so much as hand me,

38:59.980 --> 39:01.100
a maid's slippers,

39:01.100 --> 39:02.390
let alone aspire to

39:02.390 --> 39:03.060
our Miss!

39:03.580 --> 39:03.980
I...

39:04.230 --> 39:04.660
You...

39:05.230 --> 39:05.790
Get lost!

39:06.750 --> 39:07.610
Leave quickly.

39:09.270 --> 39:10.330
How embarrassing.

39:12.430 --> 39:13.060
Go!

39:13.870 --> 39:14.500
Pah!

39:30.540 --> 39:31.460
Fourth Miss,

39:31.710 --> 39:32.650
Miss Rong's courtyard

39:32.650 --> 39:34.100
never allows unauthorized entry.

39:34.100 --> 39:35.460
While no one notices,

39:35.950 --> 39:37.270
let's leave quickly.

39:37.460 --> 39:39.350
The new tea is about to harvest,

39:39.910 --> 39:42.230
Rong Shanbao is holding a meeting
at Chongxi Hall.

39:42.230 --> 39:45.140
All attendants around her
were assigned to leave here.

39:45.140 --> 39:47.470
How could she pay attention to this place?

39:53.580 --> 39:56.320
It's tricky as someone is guarding there.

40:05.910 --> 40:07.170
I want to see Miss Rong.

40:07.810 --> 40:09.020
Could it be that someone else

40:09.020 --> 40:10.680
is also looking for Miss Rong?

40:23.540 --> 40:24.140
Oh no!

40:24.580 --> 40:26.110
I forgot to apply the honey.

40:26.180 --> 40:27.020
Rong Shanbao

40:27.020 --> 40:28.790
really did hide you here.

40:29.230 --> 40:31.320
[Sixth Miss of the Rong family,
Rong Yunwan]

40:48.430 --> 40:49.490
You know what to do?

40:49.830 --> 40:50.830
Yes, yes, I understand.

40:50.830 --> 40:52.500
I won't let this stand in the way of
your important work, Young Master.

40:52.500 --> 40:53.980
But if others find out...

40:54.270 --> 40:55.430
Even if all of my ten fingers

40:55.430 --> 40:56.460
were put in finger crushers,

40:56.460 --> 40:57.800
it'd be due to his own lust and folly,

40:57.800 --> 40:58.860
and he deserved it.

41:12.750 --> 41:14.230
To be a son-in-law of the Rong family,

41:14.230 --> 41:16.270
one must first maintain proper conduct.

41:16.270 --> 41:18.270
Wen Can was drunk and misbehaved tonight,

41:18.270 --> 41:20.430
how could Miss Rong still want him?

41:21.700 --> 41:24.230
After all the commotion this evening,
I can't sleep at all.

41:24.230 --> 41:24.760
Let's go.

41:25.060 --> 41:27.100
Come to my room for some chess games.

41:27.550 --> 41:28.070
Please.

41:41.910 --> 41:42.910
This is terrible.

41:44.340 --> 41:46.860
Wanwan, what are you afraid of?

41:47.820 --> 41:49.260
I'm your sister.

41:49.770 --> 41:50.930
I won't bite you.

41:54.380 --> 41:55.020
Come here.

41:55.910 --> 41:56.970
Come here quickly.

42:01.140 --> 42:02.390
It's been a while.

42:03.180 --> 42:03.950
You idiot have finally

42:03.950 --> 42:05.350
grown some brains.

42:05.880 --> 42:08.080
It's not as easy
to fool as you used to be.

42:09.310 --> 42:10.310
Fourth Sister is mean!

42:10.310 --> 42:11.310
-Fourth Sister is so fierce.
-Stay still.

42:11.310 --> 42:12.180
Let me go!

42:12.180 --> 42:12.710
Let go!

42:12.730 --> 42:13.710
Why are you running?

42:13.710 --> 42:15.830
You ill-fated scourge,
who doomed your own mother!

42:15.830 --> 42:18.690
How many more people in my family
do you want to harm?

44:55.910 --> 45:00.340
[Tea Tax]

45:00.790 --> 45:01.790
That Prefect Xu demanded

45:01.790 --> 45:02.950
double the usual tribute

45:02.950 --> 45:04.460
from our tea plantation last year.

45:04.460 --> 45:05.750
Tea tax was one of
the ancient government's

45:04.700 --> 45:05.740
[Hand over the tea tax!]

45:05.750 --> 45:07.190
most important sources of revenue.

45:06.100 --> 45:07.640
[Abuse of power? Shackle/Exile!]

45:07.500 --> 45:08.620
The Ming Dynasty's tea tax

45:08.620 --> 45:10.140
was administered on a regional basis.

45:10.140 --> 45:12.460
The Sichuan region implemented
the Official Tea System

45:12.460 --> 45:13.740
to facilitate the tea-for-horses trade

45:13.740 --> 45:15.270
with frontier tribes for horses.

45:15.270 --> 45:16.460
While Jiangnan region

45:16.460 --> 45:18.020
adopted the merchant tea system.

45:18.020 --> 45:19.620
Under the Tea License System,

45:19.620 --> 45:21.680
merchants paid
corresponding taxes

45:21.980 --> 45:23.580
for selling tea for profits.

45:24.290 --> 45:25.830
Ming Dynasty's tea taxation system

45:25.830 --> 45:27.580
was a product of political prioritization.

45:27.580 --> 45:28.500
Its primary design objective

45:28.500 --> 45:29.910
was to consolidate border security

45:29.910 --> 45:31.180
rather than to generate revenue.

45:31.180 --> 45:33.140
The paradox of low tax rates

45:33.140 --> 45:37.000
coupled with strict control
ultimately led to depressed tax yields.

45:39.100 --> 45:40.500
Although the tea-for-horses trade

45:40.500 --> 45:42.100
helped maintain frontier stability,

45:42.100 --> 45:43.500
it failed to translate effectively

45:43.500 --> 45:45.020
into a fiscal advantage.

45:45.180 --> 45:47.070
Instead, it created fertile ground

45:47.070 --> 45:48.220
for smuggling and corruption.
